st to walk period  the two were even able to share a  wedding dance together without bridges  needing oxygen to do so he accompanied  the web pose with a video to confirm he  still has some moves on the dance floor  the actor also promoted his upcoming tv  series the old man and included a sneak  peek trailer in his post he was in the  midst of filming in 2020 but the studio  had to suspend production in march of  that year because well you know why  deadline reports that it'll be his first  return to television in 50 years based  on a thomas perry novel of the same name  the series follows retired cia officer  dan chase played by bridges who finds  himself in the crosshairs of an assassin  the old man is for a projected 2022  release date filming has started back up  for the show already so that release  date seems to be on track to remain for  2022  other people shared their stories of how  bridges helped get them through their  own illnesses one fan wrote your sleep  tapes got me through my two week corona  fever sleep was hard to come by and i  was living in the strange in-between  world but every day i would put my  blanket and pillow out in the garden and  put sleep tapes in my ear and drift into  a peaceful sleep with the breeze on my  face and your voice soothing my tired  brain it's been a wild year for bridges  but as the man waxed ever so poetically  back in his march 2021 update post life  is brief and beautiful love is all  around us and available at all times  [Music]
 

